<title>NETHERLANDS: RESEARCH - Paribas reiterates ING Buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH - Paribas reiterates ING Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of results flash.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    ING		 Banking	 59.00   Paribas Capital mkts</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (unchanged). Q3 results rose 24.5 pct despite Dfl 125 million in provisions for Euro, year 2000 computer work. ING forecast of marked EPS increase must be more than quoted 7-12 pct as increase generated so far this year already 13 pct of last year's earnings and group sees better Q4 performance.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	 P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1996		   4.17	14.0	1.83</p>
<p>    1997		   4.69	12.5	2.00</p>
<p>    1998		   5.29	11.1	2.25</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
</text>
